  "source":{"language":"韩语","text":"저는 테니스를 치는 것을 좋아해요. 축구도 하고 헬스장에 가고 수영하고 달리기도 해요. 운동을 하면 기분이 좋아져요.","glossZh":"我喜欢打网球。我也踢足球、去健身房、游泳和跑步。运动后我的心情会变好。"},
  "translations":[
    {"id":"ja","language":"日语","style":"初学者 · 礼貌","text":"私はテニスをするのが好きです。サッカーをしたり、ジムに行ったり、泳いだり、走ったりもします。運動をすると気分がよくなります。","pronunciation":"Watashi wa tenisu o suru no ga suki desu. Sakkā o shitari, jimu ni ittari, oyoidari, hashittari mo shimasu. Undō o suru to kibun ga yoku narimasu.","vocabulary":[{"term":"私","meaningZh":"我","pronunciation":"watashi","kana":"わたし"},{"term":"は","meaningZh":"主题助词","pronunciation":"wa"},{"term":"テニス","meaningZh":"网球","pronunciation":"tenisu","kana":"てにす","focus":true},{"term":"を","meaningZh":"宾语助词","pronunciation":"o"},{"term":"する","meaningZh":"做、进行","pronunciation":"suru"},{"term":"の","meaningZh":"把动词名词化","pronunciation":"no"},{"term":"が","meaningZh":"主语助词","pronunciation":"ga"},{"term":"好き","meaningZh":"喜欢","pronunciation":"suki","kana":"すき","focus":true},{"term":"です","meaningZh":"是（礼貌句尾）","pronunciation":"desu"},{"term":"サッカー","meaningZh":"足球","pronunciation":"sakkā","kana":"さっかー","focus":true},{"term":"したり","meaningZh":"做…等等","pronunciation":"shitari"},{"term":"ジム","meaningZh":"健身房","pronunciation":"jimu","kana":"じむ","focus":true},{"term":"に","meaningZh":"去、到","pronunciation":"ni"},{"term":"行ったり","meaningZh":"去…等等","pronunciation":"ittari","kana":"いったり"},{"term":"泳いだり","meaningZh":"游泳等等","pronunciation":"oyoidari","kana":"およいだり","focus":true},{"term":"走ったり","meaningZh":"跑步等等","pronunciation":"hashittari","kana":"はしったり","focus":true},{"term":"も","meaningZh":"也","pronunciation":"mo"},{"term":"します","meaningZh":"做、进行（礼貌）","pronunciation":"shimasu"},{"term":"運動","meaningZh":"运动","pronunciation":"undō","kana":"うんどう","focus":true},{"term":"と","meaningZh":"当…时、就…","pronunciation":"to"},{"term":"気分","meaningZh":"心情","pronunciation":"kibun","kana":"きぶん"},{"term":"よく","meaningZh":"变好地","pronunciation":"yoku"},{"term":"なります","meaningZh":"变成、变得","pronunciation":"narimasu"}],"keywords":[]},
    {"id":"pt-BR","language":"巴西葡语","style":"初学者 · 日常","text":"Eu gosto de jogar tênis. Também jogo futebol, vou à academia, nado e corro. Fazer exercício me faz sentir bem.","pronunciation":"Eu gosto de jogar tênis. Também jogo futebol, vou à academia, nado e corro. Fazer exercício me faz sentir bem.","vocabulary":[{"term":"Eu","meaningZh":"我","pronunciation":"eu"},{"term":"gosto","meaningZh":"喜欢","pronunciation":"GOS-to","focus":true},{"term":"de","meaningZh":"做…的（连接词）","pronunciation":"de"},{"term":"jogar","meaningZh":"打、玩（球类）","pronunciation":"zho-GAR"},{"term":"tênis","meaningZh":"网球","pronunciation":"TE-nis","focus":true},{"term":"Também","meaningZh":"也","pronunciation":"tam-BEIM"},{"term":"jogo","meaningZh":"我踢、我打","pronunciation":"ZHO-go"},{"term":"futebol","meaningZh":"足球","pronunciation":"fu-te-BOL","focus":true},{"term":"vou","meaningZh":"我去","pronunciation":"vou"},{"term":"à","meaningZh":"到、去（介词）","pronunciation":"a"},{"term":"academia","meaningZh":"健身房","pronunciation":"a-ka-de-MI-a","focus":true},{"term":"nado","meaningZh":"我游泳","pronunciation":"NA-do","focus":true},{"term":"e","meaningZh":"和","pronunciation":"i"},{"term":"corro","meaningZh":"我跑步","pronunciation":"KO-ho","focus":true},{"term":"Fazer","meaningZh":"做、进行","pronunciation":"fa-ZER"},{"term":"exercício","meaningZh":"运动","pronunciation":"e-zer-SI-siu"},{"term":"me","meaningZh":"我（受格）","pronunciation":"me"},{"term":"faz","meaningZh":"使得","pronunciation":"fas"},{"term":"sentir","meaningZh":"感觉","pronunciation":"sen-TIR"},{"term":"bem","meaningZh":"好","pronunciation":"bem"}],"keywords":[]},
